Better luck next game.  My recommendation would have been to use the
wand of digging to engrave Elbereth.  If you have a pet, that can
really work.  It won't take care of elves and soldier-types but at
least it gives you a break.  Just be careful not to fight while
standing on the engraving from the wand of digging as it will erode.

